Backport of tenstorrent/tt-metal#56433.

Exposes the experimental fabric mux descriptor configuration to Python, which
tt-lang needs and the pinned tt-metal does not carry. Upstream's own unit test
is left out: tt-lang does not run tt-metal's test suite, and omitting it keeps
the patch to the files the binding needs. Remove this patch once TT_METAL_TAG
names a tt-metal that contains that pull request.

